  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "One shortcoming of the new personal mirror compared to the mod implementation, is that you can only have one.\nThe mod implementation would have a few predefined presets, such as \"ceiling mirror\" or \"45 degree mirror\", \"transparent mirror\", etc. \nNot only was this useful for spawning in the exact type of mirror you wanted, you could have multiple of them spawned in at the same time. \nThis came in quite useful for setting up multiple mirrors in my playspace beforehand and then forgetting about it.\nAs the current implementation only allows for a single mirror, I keep having to reconfigure it and take it with me every time I move around, while there could just have been another mirror there instead.",
